{"unit_id":"ruanimal__dsh-sidebar-panel-buttons#card-zh","repo":"ruanimal/dsh-sidebar-panel-buttons","commit":"1216846302abc45db9aa00fa70c5b32808a25a43","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panel-buttons（DSH Web 插件）：把侧边栏顶部的全局面板菜单从竖排文字列表改为横向图标按钮。它在浏览器客户端扫描侧边栏面板行并注入样式，同时向设置 → 通用注册布局切换项。用户可选择紧凑按钮行或原始列表，图标悬停时显示菜单名称提示，选择保存在浏览器 localStorage。适合希望减少侧边栏面板菜单占用空间的 DSH Web 用户；需安装到 DSH profile，无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:87-120","lib/client.js:501-529","lib/client.js:539-578"]}
{"unit_id":"ruanimal__dsh-sidebar-panel-buttons#card-en","repo":"ruanimal/dsh-sidebar-panel-buttons","commit":"1216846302abc45db9aa00fa70c5b32808a25a43","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sidebar-panel-buttons turns the DSH Web sidebar panel menu into compact icon buttons. A browser scan styles the rows, and Settings → General lets users switch back to the labelled list. Hover reveals each menu name; the choice persists in localStorage. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:87-120","lib/client.js:501-529","lib/client.js:539-578"]}
