{"unit_id":"ruanimal__dsh-sidebar-panel-buttons#feature-1","repo":"ruanimal/dsh-sidebar-panel-buttons","commit":"1216846302abc45db9aa00fa70c5b32808a25a43","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panel-buttons 的功能「侧边栏面板菜单紧凑排列」：把展开侧边栏顶部的全局面板入口排成横向图标行，并隐藏常驻文字标签。菜单行由浏览器客户端扫描标记，样式只作用于该面板区域。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:87-120","lib/client.js:315-400"]}
